          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Live Search No Result Fallback -->
        <div id="faqNoResults" class="text-center p-4 bg-surface-soft rounded-4 border border-subtle mb-4" style="display: none;">
          <i class="bi bi-search text-muted fs-1 mb-2"></i>
          <h4 class="fw-bold">No Matching Questions Found</h4>
          <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Try searching for a different term or contact our project advisors directly.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="accordion" id="faqAccordion">
          <!-- Item 1 -->
          <div class="accordion-item mb-3 rounded-3 overflow-hidden border border-subtle">
            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faqHead1">
              <button class="accordion-button fw-bold fs-6" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqCollapse1" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="faqCollapse1">
                How do you ensure a 100% dust-free preparation process?
              </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="faqCollapse1" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" aria-labelledby="faqHead1" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
              <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
                We utilize German Festool HEPA-certified automatic extraction sanding systems attached directly to our orbital sanders. In addition, we erect negative-air containment barriers and cover all HVAC vents to prevent airborne drywall particulate from circulating into living areas.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Item 2 -->
          <div class="accordion-item mb-3 rounded-3 overflow-hidden border border-subtle">
            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faqHead2">
              <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-bold fs-6" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqCollapse2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqCollapse2">
                What is the difference between authentic Venetian plaster and textured faux paint?
              </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="faqCollapse2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="faqHead2" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
              <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
                Authentic Venetian plaster is crafted from matured slaked lime and crushed Carrara marble. It chemically petrifies back into limestone on your wall, offering genuine mineral depth, natural mold resistance, and breathability. Faux paint is simply acrylic paint rolled on with texture additives and lacks the tactile coolness and longevity of true plaster.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Item 3 -->
          <div class="accordion-item mb-3 rounded-3 overflow-hidden border border-subtle">
            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faqHead3">
              <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-bold fs-6" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqCollapse3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqCollapse3">
                Are your paints completely odor-free and safe for children and pets?
              </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="faqCollapse3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="faqHead3" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
              <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
                Yes. We strictly use certified Zero-VOC mineral and plant-based coatings. There are zero harmful off-gassing chemicals, meaning you can occupy the freshly painted space immediately on the same evening without any respiratory irritation.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Item 4 -->
          <div class="accordion-item mb-3 rounded-3 overflow-hidden border border-subtle">
            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faqHead4">
              <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-bold fs-6" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqCollapse4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqCollapse4">
                What does your 10-Year Craftsmanship Warranty cover?
              </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="faqCollapse4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="faqHead4" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
              <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
                Our comprehensive warranty covers peeling, blistering, cracking, and adhesion failure resulting from substrate preparation or application. If an issue arises, our master technicians repair and recoat the area at zero cost to you.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Item 5 -->
          <div class="accordion-item mb-3 rounded-3 overflow-hidden border border-subtle">
            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faqHead5">
              <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-bold fs-6" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqCollapse5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqCollapse5">
                How long does an average full home interior painting project take?
              </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="faqCollapse5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="faqHead5" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
              <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
                A typical 3,000 sq ft luxury residence requires 5 to 7 working days, including comprehensive masking, Level 5 skim prep, dual coat application, and white-glove inspection. We commit to a firm start and finish date in our written contract.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Item 6 -->
          <div class="accordion-item mb-3 rounded-3 overflow-hidden border border-subtle">
            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faqHead6">
              <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-bold fs-6" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqCollapse6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqCollapse6">
                Do you provide physical color and plaster samples before work begins?
              </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="faqCollapse6" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="faqHead6" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
              <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
                Absolutely. We create custom 12x12 inch physical mock-up boards in your exact desired color and sheen so you can observe the finish under natural morning and evening indoor lighting before approving production.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- STILL HAVE QUESTIONS CTA -->
        <div class="p-4 p-md-5 bg-surface rounded-4 border border-subtle shadow-sm mt-4 text-center">
